The broadcaster, lane/BSD inference policy, image preprocessing, settings,
HTTP service and diagnostic protocol are ported from
openpilot/selfdrive/carrot/xiaoge_data.py and openpilot/selfdrive/carrot/xiaoge/
in this repository. Their original MIT license and source provenance remain
applicable; see the root LICENSE.

OpenCV and libjpeg-turbo are external native dependencies, separately documented
in ../opencv-runtime/PROVENANCE.md and ../jpeg/PROVENANCE.md. The original ONNX
model assets are retained unchanged. Python is used for source comparisons and
build tooling, and is not embedded or invoked by the native runtime.
